dhciUyMC0lMjBUaGUlMjBCZWFzdCUyMFdpdGhpbiUyMCUyODIwMjUlMjkv.1.3","title":"Jaati, Kabhi Nahi Jaati","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2025-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The mystery around the dead body and Sarju’s murder grows deeper. The tribals protest against Shambhu’s arrest. Hemant is shocked to learn that he must now choose between his identity and his duty.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fZ2vexGKz8KBtnYRauMXtphSH08.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9KYW5hYXdhciUyMC0lMjBUaGUlMjBCZWFzdCUyMFdpdGhpbiUyMCUyODIwMjUlMjkv.1.4","title":"Purana Paap","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2025-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Mamaji and Gopi, arrested for Sarju’s murder, are beaten up. They confess to the crime, but something seems off. Hemant is stunned when the loose ends of the case lead to his trusted ally, Kailash.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bSAZcAUVOrTBngPA5wQWXYib9w7.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9KYW5hYXdhciUyMC0lMjBUaGUlMjBCZWFzdCUyMFdpdGhpbiUyMCUyODIwMjUlMjkv.1.5","title":"Apsara","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2025-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Kailash, once the police’s trusted ally, is now in custody as a suspect. A brutally beaten-up Kailash opens up to Hemant about his wife, Manda, and his connection to Sarju’s case.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lgBPhMQHB8fZccREFwKrGbNjve0.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9KYW5hYXdhciUyMC0lMjBUaGUlMjBCZWFzdCUyMFdpdGhpbiUyMCUyODIwMjUlMjkv.1.6","title":"Aur Kaun?","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2025-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The entire unit is stunned at Kailash’s confession, but the case is far from being solved with new revelations. Suspecting Kailash’s relation to more crimes, Hemant plays a trick.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ciD4Lpcfi3XVxuwqEv19IJLnwix.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZ